{"_id":"rp:cia-6-prism-engineers","dataset":"cia","dtype":"research-pass","schema_version":"0.9.0","version":1,"date_added":"2026-07-31T03:34:00-04:00","date_updated":"2026-07-31T03:34:00-04:00","sources":[],"evidence":[],"data":{"research_question":"Which publicly named engineers and technical leaders can be tied to implementation layers surrounding PRISM, Section 702 provider collection, and provider compliance systems?","method":"Search official agency biographies, declassified implementation records, official company material, conference biographies, contemporaneous technical reporting, and public professional profiles. Classify launch-era technical authority, direct engineering, successor portal engineering, operations, testing, and technical public response separately.","classification_rules":["A technical executive is not labeled a coder unless a source says so.","A later law-enforcement portal is not represented as the original PRISM implementation.","A public professional profile supports only the role and work explicitly described.","Cyber FISA implementation architecture is related evidence and is not silently relabeled as the precise PRISM path.","No personal contact data is collected."],"source_ids":["s:asb-teresa-shea","s:nsa-john-inglis","s:fbi-marcus-thomas-otd","s:fbi-amy-hess-otd","s:cyberscoop-rob-joyce-sso","s:usenix-rob-joyce","s:nsarchive-sso-fbi-implementation","s:microsoft-law-enforcement-conference-2008","s:intch-brian-faucher","s:signalhire-emmanuel-mills","s:powertofly-matt-atkins","s:linkedin-chris-thomas-meta","s:google-lers-official","s:wired-google-secure-ftp","s:wired-yonatan-zunger-prism"],"iteration":6}}
